{"brief": "为 XGO Duck 设计一个友好、有辨识度的头顶外观装饰件，具体视觉主题由你决定。保留原机器人和相机，不做尖锐或夸张笨重的造型。希望它作为个性化可打印原型展示；安装方式和真实运动性能仍待验证。请根据实际整机与近景渲染进行有限轮审查和修改。", "recipe": {"schema_version": "fk-robot-part-v1", "zone_sha256": "b6e92b2a80c9501f6ae1aea3c52e5d584e8df5a18f9981e0207d796cb7f12c49", "name": "duckling_crest_puff_mk2c", "rationale": "Round-2 plan after round-1 rejections: the enlarged silhouette was geometrically valid (all lowest-Z inside the 3 mm base) but hit a STEP-vs-CAD volume mismatch of ~0.8-0.9%, likely a boolean/tolerance artifact aggravated by many overlapping ellipsoids with compound rotations. Fix: reduce to two puffs with simple single-axis rotations to lower boolean complexity while keeping the enlarged, recognizable friendly crest. Base stays 18x16x3; center puff 15x12x10 at [0,0,6.8] tilted only -10 deg about X (rotated Z half-extent ~5.37, lowest Z ~+1.43 mm, inside base with full XY overlap); single bilateral side puff (Y=+4 only, host mirrors) 10x6x7 at [-2.5,4,6] with one -15 deg X tilt (lowest Z ~+2.83 mm, overlapping base and center puff). No feature below Z=0; total ~18x16x~13 mm well inside 80x80x35 mm; mass far under 16 g. Whole-robot and close-up renders confirm the round-0/1 crest position is clear of the front camera lens and dome and merely needs presence, which this scale restores. Soft rounded ellipsoids only, no sharp intimidating edges. Adhesive-pad attachment, curvature fit, printability and walking remain open per the brief.", "symmetry": "bilateral", "material": "pla", "color_rgb": [1.0, 0.72, 0.2], "base_size_mm": [18.0, 16.0, 3.0], "features": [{"shape": "ellipsoid", "size_mm": [15.0, 12.0, 10.0], "center_mm": [0.0, 0.0, 6.8], "rotation_deg": [-10.0, 0.0, 0.0]}, {"shape": "ellipsoid", "size_mm": [10.0, 6.0, 7.0], "center_mm": [-2.5, 4.0, 6.0], "rotation_deg": [-15.0, 0.0, 0.0]}]}, "recipe_sha256": "73fa5dc7fbff117625e004bce5722f34396e1c41d1f165bfcff9794a95a2c409", "build": {"directory": "/home/exuber/CODE/CORE/pythonProject1/AUTORESEARCH/fluxkernel/.demo/v010-personalization/robot-pal-6985339a/round-02/xgoduck-part-0610b949", "native_sha256": "4a5f6cebb373e2ad8d8f5b3cd4f4692c264f356ad347cdce5a7f2b8dcd29f161", "name": "xgoduck", "bodies": 16, "joints": 15, "actuators": 14, "meshes": 16, "mass_kg": 0.8021487726055273, "proof_accepted": true, "deployment_ready": false, "accepted": true, "motion_passed": true, "motion_summary": {"minimum_distance_m": 0.01606420654253603, "violations": []}, "part_body": "custom_duckling_crest_puff_mk2c", "added_mass_kg": 0.0021487833055272654, "interface_status": "unverified", "recipe_sha256": "73fa5dc7fbff117625e004bce5722f34396e1c41d1f165bfcff9794a95a2c409"}, "properties": {"bbox_mm": [[-9.0000001, -8.0000001, 0.0], [9.0000001, 8.0000001, 11.8330598637697]], "volume_mm3": 1732.889762521988, "mass_kg": 0.0021487833055272654, "inertial_position": [-0.0003152436501654487, -3.143420156975344e-05, 0.0047187388789692785], "principal_inertia": [4.744060152087901e-08, 5.411881827156849e-08, 6.021794291643562e-08], "inertial_quaternion": [0.9991579590928213, -0.027536570687749812, 0.030313773204370374, -0.0024870083112986797], "vertices": 4503, "faces": 6870, "solids": 1, "density_kg_m3": 1240.0, "mass_basis": "Uniform solid CAD and declared nominal polymer density; not measured print mass", "integration": "Gauss-Kronrod volume (1e-8); fixed Gaussian COM/inertia, inertia normalized to GK mass. Numerical estimates, not physical measurements.", "files": {"part.step": "e955f8d62a04331c30cb50d7bfab954c483c59944cba6b4f530b00f2f0833938", "part.py": "fc11ce361d24863a52d0116bb443be4ab993e88d5a49c459cb2ff8b37f264818", "recipe.json": "3fe87cb7a98d0758585bdf63929ed7ab81d1faa1abadc00f755aa5eff0b02fcf", "part.obj": "c40238da0759e75a0591f9586ff2dc66f463b580dc90e0d7286f16156a31f474", "part.stl": "a2081304a50fc918972ddca9432c34d897810f13006c0b17efa15b73d2e7387a"}}, "motion": {"accepted": true, "poses": [{"pose": 0, "minimum_distance_m": 0.020877335773261674, "nearest_geometry": "mjobj_geom_11", "accept